                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">9867ef47-af39-4d67-8125-43ab27746f1d</item>
                    <item name="Italic" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">9</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 3  -  Floor levels
Goal: a centre point at the height of every floor.
Idea: Total height = Floors × Floor-to-floor. Each floor's
   height = t × total. Construct Point turns those heights into
   points.
Watch for: This replaces B01's Unit Z + Move: every floor gets
   its own height in one go.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="1">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="2">
                        <item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35">
                          <X>1060</X>
                          <Y>60</Y>
                          <W>263.3623</W>
                          <H>80.541016</H>
                        </item>
                        <item name="Pivot" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                          <X>1065</X>
                          <Y>65</Y>
                        </item>
                      </items>
                    </chunk>
                  </chunks>
                </chunk>
              </chunks>
            </chunk>
            <chunk name="Object" index="52">
              <items count="2">
                <item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">7f5c6c55-f846-4a08-9c9a-cfdc285cc6fe</item>
                <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="13">
                    <item name="Bold" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Ca" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>1719</X>
                      <Y>65</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Cb" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>1959.6973</X>
                      <Y>65</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Cc" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>1959.6973</X>
                      <Y>145.78467</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Cd" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                      <X>1719</X>
                      <Y>145.78467</Y>
                    </item>
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A quick note</item>
                    <item name="Font" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Arial</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">c68e0832-7f09-41b2-8222-42f8a304cba6</item>
                    <item name="Italic" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">9</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 4  -  Taper the size
Goal: a radius and a fillet for every floor, blending from the
   base values to the top values.
Idea: Blend = base × (1 - t) + top × t, plus the bulge. At the
   base t = 0, at the top t = 1, and the bulge adds width at
   mid-height.
Watch for: Multiply first, then add: the two shares add up to
   one value per floor.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="1">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="2">
                        <item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35">
                          <X>1714</X>
                          <Y>60</Y>
                          <W>250.69727</W>
                          <H>90.78467</H>
                        </item>
                        <item name="Pivot" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                          <X>1719</X>
                          <Y>65</Y>
                        </item>
                      </items>
                    </chunk>
                  </chunks>
                </chunk>
              </chunks>
            </chunk>
            <chunk name="Object" index="53">
