                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 9  -  Close the mass
Goal: a closed solid (Brep): the tower mass.
Idea: Loft leaves the top and bottom open; Cap Holes adds flat
   lids to planar openings.
Watch for: Only flat (planar) openings can be capped.</item>
                  </items>
