                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 10  -  Check your result
Goal: a number that proves the mass is right.
Idea: Read outputs as data, not just as a picture. Area gives
   the surface area (sf) and the centroid.
Watch for: Set Total twist to 0: the area drops, because
   twisting stretches the skin.</item>
